# Traffic Digital Twin - DGP Demonstration MVP

> **Requirements revision — 2026-09-17:** The requested target uses a Python API gateway, owning Go domain services and a dedicated Go DB writer. The repository currently implements Next.js → Go → Python compute/ PostgreSQL; the migration is not implemented. Sections 9–11 and 32–34 are authoritative for the revised architecture and production gates. Earlier roadmap dates and historical completion claims are not current acceptance. See [evidence-based audit](docs/UX-PRODUCTION-AUDIT.md) and [all epics/stories](docs/DELIVERY-PLAN.md). This revision changes planning documents only. No live physical signal control is authorized.


**Document type:** Product Requirements Document (PRD)  
**Target build window:** 10-15 calendar days  
**Primary audience:** Founder/Product, Frontend, Go Backend, ML/Simulation, QA/Demo team  
**Demo audience:** DGP / senior Traffic Police / control-room stakeholders  
**Operating mode:** Demonstration + simulation only; no live Odisha signal control  
**Data policy for MVP:** Synthetic traffic + sample/public traffic video only. Real police/CCTV/controller data is explicitly out of scope until authorized after tender/approval.

