- Always honor amber and all-red.
- Never exceed configured min/max green.
- Never allow optimizer to bypass manual lock.
- If intelligence service is unavailable, recommendations stop.
- If state confidence is low, UI displays degraded status.
- Manual mode must disable new recommendations immediately.
- Emergency mode may change priority but not safety constraints.
